# ─── 7. SCOPE — the pre-ADR-037 system (ADR-037, 2026-11-02) ─────────────
# The remote branch carries the canonical, multi-device, prod-deployable code
# only: the DOM (`src/contracts/`), the store client (`src/data/`), the
# service layer (`src/services/`), the transport (`src/transport/`), the
# vault prose, the specs and the tests of those.
#
# The pre-ADR-037 runtime is UNPUBLISHED, not deleted: the files stay on the
# owner's disk and in the git history; they are simply not on the branch.
# The first execution of ADR-037 ignored individual FILES inside trees that
# stayed published — so 84 of the 91 files in `sys_ikigai/` and 25 of the 26
# in `src/mesh/` kept shipping. The trees are now unpublished as units.
/sys_ikigai/
/src/mesh/
/interfaces/
